<title>INDIA: Bombay blue chips off day's lows, drift higher.</title>
<headline>Bombay blue chips off day's lows, drift higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>**  (0800 GMT) - Bombay shares cap early losses, trade in</p>
<p>	  positive territory as supply from local funds dry up</p>
<p>	  near lower levels, traders say</p>
<p>**  Reliance trades marginally lower ahead of Thursday</p>
<p>	  bonus share announcement</p>
<p>**  Bombay share index up 4.38 points at 4,123.77, above</p>
<p>	  4,078.32 -- intra-day low</p>
<p>**  Zandu Pharma surges four percent at 3,553.0 rupees</p>
<p>	  before bonus meet</p>
<p>**  National exchange index gains 1.23 pct at 1,169.55 on</p>
<p>	  first day of weekly account</p>
<p>--  Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
